{"code":"YL20","wikidata":"Q119009914","wikipedia":{"en":"Si Dan MRT station","th":"สถานีศรีด่าน"},"summary":{"en":"Si Dan station is a Bangkok MRT station on the Yellow Line. The station is located on Sringarindra Road in Samut Prakan Province and is a portmanteau of the name of Srinagarindra and Dan Samrong (Sukhumvit 113) roads, of which intersect adjacent to the station. The station has four entrances.","th":"สถานีศรีด่าน เป็นสถานีรถไฟฟ้ามหานครแบบยกระดับในเส้นทางสายสีเหลือง โดยยกระดับเหนือถนนศรีนครินทร์ในพื้นที่อำเภอเมืองสมุทรปราการ จังหวัดสมุทรปราการ"},"opened":"2023-06-03","photos":[{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4f/Si_Dan_Station_01.jpg/960px-Si_Dan_Station_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Si_Dan_Station_01.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9b/Si_Dan_Station_02.jpg/960px-Si_Dan_Station_02.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Si_Dan_Station_02.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3c/Si_Dan_Station_03.jpg/960px-Si_Dan_Station_03.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Si_Dan_Station_03.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/15/Si_Dan_Station_04.jpg/960px-Si_Dan_Station_04.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Si_Dan_Station_04.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3d/Si_Dan_Station_05.jpg/960px-Si_Dan_Station_05.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&ut